      "avatar": "./assets/members/member-01.jpg?v=20260917192332",
      "side": "right",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "社媒助手离线版本：\n🔗 离线版下载：\nhttps://socialext.com/download?channel=offline\n📖 离线安装教程：\nhttps://socialext.com/help/faq/browser/offline-install",
